  This is the GNU grep v. 2.0 slightly modified to compile under OSK.All the mods are marked by "#ifdef OSK" or "#ifndef OSK". The providedmakefile was used to compile the program with GNU gcc2 ver. 2.5.6. Theresulting object program should run on all 68000 series processors: I havetested it on 68030 and 68070 (which is essentially 68000). The postscripttranslation (made by groff) of the original troff-type manual has beenadded.  The program is much faster and has more useful options that any other "grep"for OSK I know.   Andrzej Kotanski(kotanski@zeus02.desy.de)                                                 Cracow, Feb. 15, 1994